## Commands

```bash
# Frontend Development
cd REDACTED-LOCAL-PATH/mixtape-release-frontend
yarn dev          # Start dev server on port 3010

# Backend Development
cd REDACTED-LOCAL-PATH/mixtape-release-core
python manage.py runserver 8010  # Start backend on port 8010

# Production
yarn build        # Production build
yarn lint         # Run ESLint

# File locations
# Frontend: REDACTED-LOCAL-PATH/mixtape-release-frontend
# Backend:  REDACTED-LOCAL-PATH/mixtape-release-core
```

